{"overview":{"Symbol":"HNGE","Name":"Hinge Health, Inc.","Description":"Hinge Health, Inc. focuses on building a health system that scales and automates the delivery of care using technology. It designs its platform to address musculoskeletal system care (MSK), including acute injury, chronic pain, and post-surgical rehabilitation. The company also provides personalized and automated MSK care through AI-powered motion tracking technology and a proprietary electrical nerve stimulation wearable device. It primarily serves self-insured employers. The company was founded in 2012 and is headquartered in San Francisco, California.","CIK":"","Exchange":"NYSE","Currency":"USD","Country":"United States","Sector":"Healthcare","Industry":"Health Information Services","Address":"455 Market Street, San Francisco, CA, 94105, United States","FiscalYearEnd":"","LatestQuarter":"","MarketCapitalization":"5009202688","EBITDA":"-525336000","PERatio":"","PEGRatio":"","BookValue":"1.445","DividendPerShare":"","DividendYield":"","EPS":"-8.92","RevenuePerShareTTM":"9.181","ProfitMargin":"-0.78948","OperatingMarginTTM":"0.17591","ReturnOnAssetsTTM":"-0.45743","ReturnOnEquityTTM":"-1.36003","RevenueTTM":"646342016","GrossProfitTTM":"523407008","DilutedEPSTTM":"-8.92","QuarterlyEarningsGrowthYOY":"1.05","QuarterlyRevenueGrowthYOY":"0.472","AnalystTargetPrice":"70.86667","TrailingPE":"","ForwardPE":"20.575418","PriceToSalesRatioTTM":"7.7500806","PriceToBookRatio":"44.799305","EVToRevenue":"7.261","EVToEBITDA":"-8.934","Beta":"","52WeekHigh":"66.55","52WeekLow":"30.08","50DayMovingAverage":"49.4714","200DayMovingAverage":"47.5217","SharesOutstanding":"54655926","DividendDate":"","ExDividendDate":"","DebtToEquity":"2.237"},"daily":{"Meta Data":{"1. Information":"Daily Time Series (Yahoo Finance, shaped like Alpha Vantage)","2. Symbol":"HNGE","3. Last Refreshed":"2026-10-30","4. Output Size":"Compact"},"Time Series (Daily)":{"2026-04-06":{"1. open":"39","2. high":"39.810001373291016","3. low":"38